      en: ["Empties into the Atlantic Ocean near Santana.", "Historically supplied the Água Izé plantation.", "Drainage basin covers southeastern São Tomé.", "Surrounded by ecologically valuable mangroves.", "Used for irrigation since the 16th century.", "Important habitat for the endemic São Tomé Weaver."],
