      en: ["Part of the UNESCO Biosphere Reserve of Príncipe.", "Connected to the main island by a long wooden bridge.", "Nesting site for Green and Hawksbill sea turtles.", "Whale watching season runs from July to October.", "Home to the endemic Príncipe Kingfisher.", "Surrounded by pristine coral reefs and turquoise waters."],
