      en: "Baía das Agulhas, the 'Bay of Needles,' is one of the most spectacular coastal stretches of Príncipe. It owes its name to the striking, needle-shaped basalt formations that rise steeply from the turquoise water. This bay is a place of wild, untouched beauty where dense rainforest reaches directly to the edge of the cliffs and the Atlantic surf beats relentlessly against the rock."
